    "description": "Hello everyone! This time, I'm bringing you the 4K 60fps remastered version of the Aerial Base wallpaper🔥!\r\n\r\nHighlights of the current version✨ - \r\n🌞 Day-Night Cycle🌙: \r\nThe scene now automatically switches based on system time. There are three states: Day - Dusk - Night.\r\nClock Display Feature🕒: \r\nA simple clock display feature that can be turned on or off at any time. (Currently, the clock position cannot be adjusted.)\r\n\r\nSound Effects Toggle and Volume Control🔊: \r\nYou can turn sound effects on or off at any time, as well as adjust the volume.\r\n\r\nThis should be the final version of my Aerial Base wallpaper, and there will be no further modifications or resets. I hope you enjoy it.\r\n\r\n【Note: Since this wallpaper is in HTML format, it cannot be used on mobile devices📱.】\r\n\r\nIf you experience issues such as a black screen, crashes, or lag that prevent normal use, please consider using the Independent 4K or 1080P versions from the [盖亚奥特曼] 空中基地 合集 Collection.\r\n\r\nIf you want to use it on mobile devices such as phones or tablets, please also choose the Independent 4K or 1080P versions from the [盖亚奥特曼] 空中基地 合集 Collection.",
