    "title": "Clochard",
    "description": "Immerse yourself in the magic of sounds and colors with amazing wallpapers that dance in harmony with the music of your soul. We are what we listen to, and this wallpaper will become your visual reflection. Let the colors of your favorite track covers become the brush that will paint your world with personality and uniqueness. Create a unique symphony of color where every note is a new shade of your passion for music.\r\n\r\nA portrait version of this wallpaper:\r\n [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3137026004] link to workshop [/url]\r\n\r\nThe original Lazarus wallpaper is made by the esteemed Blvk_Knxght, go to his workshop to see the beautiful artwork that inspired me. I took his wallpaper and reinterpreted it a bit, giving it a whole new style and custom interactions. <3\r\n\r\nThis is my first experience in creating this type of project, if you find a mistake, or know how to improve the wallpaper, write! I am always open to requests, suggestions, and training ;)\r\n\r\nANIMATION CREDIT:\r\nAnimation by  [url=https://steamcommunity.com/id/Blvk_Knxght/myworkshopfiles/?appid=431960] Blvk_Knxght [/url]\r\n\r\nTAGS: music, spotify, media, ui, font, dark, noise, skull, white, visual, colorfull\r\n\r\n⪢ DISCLAIMER ⪡\r\nThis animation contains artwork created by others. I have made every effort to properly credit the original creators and to obtain permission for its use. If you believe that your work has been used without proper credit or permission, please contact me and i will promptly correct the attribution or remove the material. I appreciate the support of the creative community and respect the rights of all artists.",
